    <!-- 권한 화면의 대화상자. One, because only one thing on this screen
         needs a question asked: which app to block. Turning a switch off
         is undone by turning it back on, and a confirmation in front of
         something reversible only teaches people to click past
         confirmations.
         Left without answering three ways: 닫기, the dimmed window, and
         Escape. -->
    <div class="backdrop" id="dlg-perm-app">
      <div class="modal wide appear">
        <h3>앱 막기</h3>
        <p>고른 앱은 표준 사용자 계정에서 실행되지 않습니다. 관리자 계정에서는 그대로 열립니다.</p>
        <div class="search"><span>찾기</span><input id="perm-app-q" placeholder="앱 이름"></div>
        <div class="picker" id="perm-app-list"></div>
        <div class="caption" id="perm-app-none" hidden>찾는 이름이 목록에 없습니다</div>
        <div class="foot">
          <button class="btn quiet pressable" data-close="dlg-perm-app">닫기</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>